ence) and decision quality, technical competence. That strengthens C. But we still have concerns: communication difficulty, egocentric, not willing to further education (adaptability). Also B's communication concerns. Need to compare.\n\nWe could ask Sarah for any observations on C's crew cooperation (positive atmosphere noted by Sarah earlier? Actually Sarah noted that C creates positive atmosphere with crew? That was in structured notes: \"creates positive atmosphere with his crew\". That is not yet publicly mentioned. So Emily could bring that up: \"Sarah, you mentioned C creates positive atmosphere with his crew; can you elaborate?\" That would provide crew cooperation evidence for C.\n\nThus Emily can say: I still lean toward B but need more info on C's crew cooperation. Ask Sarah. Also maybe ask about D's crew cooperation.\n\nWe need to include a vote in metadata. Likely still Candidate B.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: mention that James confirmed C's stress resilience, which strengthens C, but still concerns about communication and adaptability. I still think B is best but need more info on C's crew cooperation; ask Sarah for details. Also maybe ask about D's crew cooperation.\n\nLet's craft."}
